# Reputation
#
# There is no reputation table in the Catharsis runtime.  There is no score
# attached to Alice anywhere.  What there is:
#
#   * witnessing, which puts an observer into the victim's shoes at 55% strength
#   * confiding, which hands a *memory* -- claim and all -- to somebody else,
#     believed in proportion to how much they trust the teller
#   * contagion, which leaks feeling along every edge of the graph in proportion
#     to trust, with warnings travelling further than praise
#
# Reputation is what those three do together.  Watch it reach Diana, who never
# met Alice and never saw anything: it arrives through Charlie, as a memory with
# a source and a confidence, not as a number.

agent alice bob charlie diana

trust bob alice 0.8
love bob alice 0.5

# Charlie and Diana are a going concern of their own.
trust charlie diana 0.7
trust diana charlie 0.7
love diana charlie 0.4

betray alice bob
witness charlie alice betraying bob

tick 10

observe charlie
observe diana

recall diana "alice betrayed bob"
